WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.225
The decisions: which tool names each kind
of device, and how long names may be.

2
00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:08.554
The DHCP server as the
registrant for endpoints,

3
00:00:08.554 --> 00:00:11.550
and exactly which keys
may update each zone.

4
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.025
DHCID or TXT ownership records.

5
00:00:14.025 --> 00:00:17.775
And whether Entra-joined Windows
PCs try to register at all.

6
00:00:17.775 --> 00:00:20.250
The next steps are the
things I couldn't verify.

7
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:24.024
Which Apple setting Intune's
Mac rename actually sends,

8
00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.075
and how Macs handle DHCP names.

9
00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:30.850
Whether an Entra-joined device's
display name follows an Intune rename.

10
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.745
Book 05's description
of device preparation,

11
00:00:33.745 --> 00:00:38.987
and its note on availability in the higher
government clouds, both need a recheck.

12
00:00:38.987 --> 00:00:43.974
And ask any third-party VPN vendor whether
its concentrator registers clients.

13
00:00:43.974 --> 00:00:45.112
Where does this fit?

14
00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:51.137
Book 05, Chapter 04 covers Intune-first
onboarding and the naming convention.

15
00:00:51.137 --> 00:00:55.468
Book 08 covers the AD DNS
departure in Chapter 04,

16
00:00:55.468 --> 00:01:01.963
cloud private DNS in Chapter 07, and
the migration sequence in Chapter 10.

17
00:01:01.963 --> 00:01:06.498
And two research items sit
beside this one: Trinzic Alone,

18
00:01:06.498 --> 00:01:11.612
or Trinzic Plus Cloud DDI, and
Infoblox DDI for Federal Agencies.

19
00:01:11.612 --> 00:01:15.107
One note on standing: this
is research under review,

20
00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:17.937
not an endorsement by any federal agency.

21
00:01:17.937 --> 00:01:18.700
Thank you.

22
00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:25.962
Sources: Research brief, Couldn't verify
and Agency checklist; Book 05 Ch04,

23
00:01:25.962 --> 00:01:30.962
Intune-First Onboarding;
Book 08 Ch04, Ch07 and Ch10;

24
00:01:30.962 --> 00:01:36.438
research items Trinzic Alone,
or Trinzic Plus Cloud DDI?

25
00:01:36.438 --> 00:01:39.720
and Infoblox DDI for Federal Agencies.
